Match image updates to services

Updates.view(services) builds the dashboard's list of image updates, newest
first. An entry matches a service when one of its container names equals the
service's container field, or its id or name when that field is empty,
compared lowercase with punctuation removed. Each item gains the image tag
(a colon before the last "/" is a registry port, so no tag means "latest"),
the matched service ids, and a label: the first matched service's name, else
the container name, else the image without its tag.

